  "text": "## Technology Stack\n\nAVENIQ leverages modern automation engines, artificial intelligence frameworks, and cloud infrastructure:\n\n- **Workflow Orchestration**: n8n (Self-Hosted, Enterprise Configuration)\n- **AI Models & APIs**: OpenAI API (GPT-4o), Anthropic Claude API (Sonnet/Haiku), Google Gemini API\n- **Backend & Scripting**: Node.js, TypeScript, Python\n- **Database & Storage**: PostgreSQL, Supabase, Redis\n- **Integration Protocols**: REST APIs, GraphQL, Webhooks, OAuth 2.0\n- **Deployment & Hosting**: Docker, Cloudflare, Linux VPS\n\n---",
